{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2859d410-3b40-86c4-b6a0-544ee5151e0f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:38:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rachel Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:35:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:35:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Is it all right if I ask about a drain problem? I'm calling about the water on my street, and honestly this keeps happening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:36:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Tell me what's going on and where you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 95 Kingston Avenue, up on the Historic Hill. After that nor'easter from Friday into Saturday, two days ago, the street out front turned into a pond. And it's still sitting there. Cars come through and they're throwing wakes, actual waves, up onto the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:36:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 95 Kingston Avenue, and the water's still standing in the road out front. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:36:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, still there. And, um, is it all right if I say the other part? The water's moving toward my neighbor's garage now. It's running down along the curb and it's right at the edge of their driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:36:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so it's heading toward the neighbor's garage. Has it gotten inside, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:36:49-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet that I can see. I'm not home right now, I'm at work. I'm in the custodian closet at the school, there's a mop bucket right next to me, so if I sound echoey, that's why. My husband texted me a picture a little while ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:37:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're coming through fine. Let me write this down. Do you know if there's a catch basin right there, a drain in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is one, at the corner, and it's just packed with leaves and mud. Nobody has cleaned it that I've seen. Is it all right if I ask whether that's a city drain or a state one? Because I've heard different things and I don't want to keep calling the wrong people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:37:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Kingston Avenue is a city street, so a drain on it would be ours. I'll put it in as a city catch basin at the corner by 95, blocked and flooding the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:37:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Because I'll be honest, it's been like this after every big rain, and it seems like nobody ever comes until it's already a mess. Could I ask if somebody can actually come today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:37:58-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise a time, since crews are stretched after the storm. But I'm marking it as standing water near a garage, and that gets it moved up. Let me read it back. Blocked storm drain, corner by 95 Kingston Avenue, road flooded, water heading toward a neighbor's garage. Correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:38:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. [pause] Sorry, is it all right if I give you a number in case the crew needs to reach someone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:38:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:38:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0162. That's my cell. I'll pick up if I'm not in class hallways."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:38:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0162. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:38:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rachel Singh. S-I-N-G-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:38:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Singh. I'll send this over right now. If the water gets into the garage or comes close to a house, call back right away and tell them it's urgent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I just hope somebody comes this time. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T16:38:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
